config RT_PINCTRL_SUN50I_H616
    bool "Allwinner H616 main pin controller"
    depends on RT_USING_PINCTRL && RT_USING_OFW
    default n
    help
      Provide main PIO GPIO and UART/TWI/MMC/SPI pin multiplexing.
      Includes main PIO interrupts and always-on R_PIO pin multiplexing.
      Keep firmware-programmed bank supply voltages unchanged.

